      "problem": "If $P=QR$, where \n$Q=[\\begin{aligned}5 & -1 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 4 & 6 & 2 \\\\ 4 & -2 & 4 & -5 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 6 & -3\\end{aligned}]$\nand \n$R=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 7 & 6 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 4 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 5 & 2 & 2 & -4\\end{aligned}]$, then ${p}_{34}=$",
